  HookServer --> "*" McpSession : creates one per connection
  McpSession --> McpRegistry : serves the tools of
  McpTool "*" --* McpRegistry : tools
  McpResource "*" --* McpRegistry : resources
  McpPrompt "*" --* McpRegistry : prompts
  McpPromptArgument "*" --* McpPrompt
  McpTool ..> Declaration : built from
  McpTool ..> McpResult : replies with
  McpTool ..> McpSchema : argument schemas
  KDKTools ..> McpRegistry : declares in
  KDKTools ..> KDKToolContext : acts through
  GitToolSupport ..> KDKToolContext : uses
  KDKTools ..> GitToolSupport : git tools
  KDKTools ..> McpWork : background work
  KDKTools ..> DiagnosticsCollector : code tools
  McpWork ..> McpResult : produces
